, and mixing techniques.\n2. **Gardening for food security** \u2013 Selecting crops for a 1/3-acre northeast-facing hillside in hardiness zone 9-10 with clay soil, focusing on calories, frost tolerance, and low water needs.\n3. **Fruit trees** \u2013 Specific recommendations: apple, pear, plum, peach, and cherry trees.\n4. **Small talk** \u2013 A brief greeting exchange.\n\n---\n\n## Reply to the Last Message\n\nConverting a website mockup (JPEG) into HTML/CSS using AI is a great use case. Here are several approaches:\n\n### 1. AI-Powered Design-to-Code Tools\nSeveral tools are built specifically for this:\n- **Uizard** \u2013 Upload a screenshot or mockup and it generates editable UI code.\n- **Anima** \u2013 Converts designs into HTML/CSS/React code.\n- **TeleportHQ** \u2013 Turns visual designs into front-end code.\n- **Builder.io (Visual Copilot)** \u2013 Uses AI to convert designs and screenshots into code.\n\n### "], "errors": ["", "", "", "", "", ""], "max_output_tokens_per_s": 153.0, "max_concurrent_requests": 2, "rtfx": 0.0, "mean_ttft_ms": 242.27348249405622, "median_ttft_ms": 177.25040299410466, "std_ttft_ms": 134.51224929094337, "p50_ttft_ms": 177.25040299410466, "p90_ttft_ms": 377.60994549898896, "p95_ttft_ms": 459.44195024640067, "p99_ttft_ms": 524.9075540443301, "mean_tpot_ms": 6.592991232668092, "median_tpot_ms": 6.595081872621771, "std_tpot_ms": 0.006020218561989381, "p50_tpot_ms": 6.595081872621771, "p90_tpot_ms": 6.598205507764885, "p95_tpot_ms": 6.598980885225019, "p99_tpot_ms": 6.5996011871931275, "mean_itl_ms": 6.592991232668092, "median_itl_ms": 6.58179800666403, "std_itl_ms": 0.39432192761249935, "p50_itl_ms": 6.58179800666403, "p90_itl_ms": 6.666569909430109, "p95_itl_ms": 6.706135997956153, "p99_itl_ms": 7.921747232321653, "mean_e2el_ms": 1923.4862468244198, "median_e2el_ms": 1858.521734495298, "std_e2el_ms": 133.22653489607524, "p50_e2el_ms": 1858.521734495298, "p90_e2el_ms": 2058.184468987747, "p95_e2el_ms": 2138.8348119871807, "p99_e2el_